            <h3 class="title" id="parking-pin">Parking Pin</h3><p>Save your current parking spot, find it later in Maps, or clear it when you leave. Run this shortcut when you park and choose Save This Spot. The stored location belongs to this shortcut; saving again replaces the previous spot. Demonstrates Store, Get, and Delete Stored Content in iOS 27.</p>
